es the sufficient even dimension for this one residual step from 1034 to 980. The standard runner now reproduces the new certificate alongside the existing enumeration and obstructions.\n\nValidation: `python3 -B run_checks.py` passed the full enumeration through 13 points, all existing exact certificates and rejection controls, and every new support/DP check. The edited LaTeX proof compiled successfully.\n\nThis is one internal counting refinement; the original residue and transverse thresholds remain required. It does not establish a smaller general Sidorenko counterexample or a new dimension for the full theorem.\n\nOriginal: [OpenAI's Sidorenko manuscript](https://github.com/openai/math/tree/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-counterexample-to-Sidorenkos-conjecture-September-23-2026).\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T12:28:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T15:02:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T15:01:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-09T15:01:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"4e1b9b60c2d08eb38d92d6e24415f0a724ad8987","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/statuses/e68124868f55bba9ed791ff4379c7a42ab48955b","head":{"label":"rohanarun:refine/active-support-bound","ref":"refine/active-support-bound","sha":"e68124868f55bba9ed791ff4379c7a42ab48955b","user":{"login":"rohanarun","id":11659839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU5ODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11659839?v=4","gravatar_id":"